    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i've been on warfarin for a few months now for my heart, but i really want to start eating way cleaner to help my recovery. i'm planning on adding a huge amount of leafy greens like spinach and kale to every single meal—like big smoothies and big salads throughout the day. do you think that'll help my heart health more quickly? i really want to go all in on the greens.",
